From: r00t <r00t@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] audio: include spa/pod/iter.h for the pod helpers
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

spa_pod_get_bool() and spa_pod_find_prop() live in spa/pod/iter.h.
PipeWire up to 1.4 pulled that header in through spa/pod/parser.h; 1.6 no
longer does, so the file failed to compile on Fedora 44 (PipeWire 1.6.9).

--- a/clients/audio/audio_object.cpp
+++ b/clients/audio/audio_object.cpp
@@ -13,6 +13,7 @@
 #include <spa/param/props.h>
 #include <spa/param/route.h>
 #include <spa/pod/parser.h>
+#include <spa/pod/iter.h>
 
 #include "cutefish/audio/backend.h"
 
